    m_Center: {x: 152, y: 2, z: -62}
    m_Extent: {x: 8, y: 4, z: 7}
  findKey: Find the main entrance key - the head administrator's office is upstairs
  unlockDoor: Unlock the main entrance doors (reception lobby, north side)
  restorePower: The main gate has no power - start the generator in the west gardens' maintenance yard
  openGate: Power is back - open the main gate from the security booth (north-east, by the car park)
  escape: The gate is open - get out of the campus!
  findServiceGate: The main gate is welded shut from outside. Find the old service gate in the far SOUTH-EAST corner - its lock is released from the security control room (admin building, upper floor, west)
  releaseServiceGate: Service gate found - someone at the control room console must release its lock while the others wait at the gate
  escapeService: The service gate is OPEN - get through it!
  findCrank: The generator's crank handle is locked in the clock tower's drive box (arch passage) - set the tower clock to the night shift's change-over time (security control room board)
  findGateKey: 'The service gate is padlocked too - the groundskeeper''s key is ''with the watchers'': turn the four statues round the quad fountain'
  controlRoomHint: 'Security control room: admin building, upper floor, west wing - cameras, walkie-talkies, and the gate locks'
